        "id": "6089a4cf7f6180006a664090",
        "text": "@Calvin Xu"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": "  and others have reported slower performance on the migration-utils when using NAS since May 22, 2021.  ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "I have confirmed that that there is a slowdown by means of the following actions:  After having rebuild the may 22nd release with ocfl-java 1.1.0 per ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
        "text": "@Peter Winckles"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": "  suggestion,  I sent it to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "6089a4cf7f6180006a664090",
        "text": "@Calvin Xu"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": "  who was able to confirm that the slowness is observed in the May 22nd migration-utils with the latest ocfl-java.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
