  "description": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" data-account-id=\"6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" accountid=\"6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Calvin Xu</a>  and others have reported slower performance on the migration-utils when using NAS since May 22, 2021.  <br/>\nI have confirmed that that there is a slowdown by means of the following actions:  After having rebuild the may 22nd release with ocfl-java 1.1.0 per <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5b44cac50a894e589871012b\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5b44cac50a894e589871012b\" data-account-id=\"5b44cac50a894e589871012b\" accountid=\"5b44cac50a894e589871012b\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Peter Winckles</a>  suggestion,  I sent it to <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" data-account-id=\"6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" accountid=\"6089a4cf7f6180006a664090\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Calvin Xu</a>  who was able to confirm that the slowness is observed in the May 22nd migration-utils with the latest ocfl-java.</p>",
